			"notes": "Changed \"Pick block never changes slot\" behavior so the slot doesn't change even if the picked block isn't on the hotbar. If there's space on the hotbar, the currently selected stack will be moved there, otherwise, it will be moved to the main (non-hotbar) inventory. This behavior matches the behavior in the latest full release version.\n\nUpdated the \"Pick block never changes slot\" tooltip to accurately describe its function.\n\nMarked as compatible with 1.20.1."
		},
